<h1 class="page-title">Climbing</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Mostly indoors, mostly bouldering, mostly falling.</p>

<p>I’ve been climbing for five years. Most mornings you’ll find me bouldering or training at Urban Climb: I love small holds, hate round flat ones, and spend a lot of time falling onto mats.</p>

<ul>
  <li><b>Favourite crag:</b> Bleachers, Grampians</li>
  <li><b>Current goal:</b> get strong again after travelling</li>
  <li><b>Best sends:</b> The Show Must Go On (V7), Plastic Facts (V6), Evac (V6)</li>
</ul>
